  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bingo! I smell a Lumiose local...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420069006E0067006F00210020004900200073006D0065006C006C002000610020004C0075006D0069006F007300650020006C006F00630061006C002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I mean, er, bonjour!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSorry to bother you, mate, but you wouldn’t\nhappen to have a Slowpoke, would you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Slowpoke back home in Galar have a yellow\nhead and tail, like this dapper chap here.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I hear they look different in other regions!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007500740020004900200068006500610072002000740068006500790020006C006F006F006B00200064006900660066006500720065006E007400200069006E0020006F007400680065007200200072006500670069006F006E0073002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And, lucky for me, I also hear that wild Slowpoke\nhave started popping up in Lumiose lately!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m only here on holiday for a little while, so I’m\nkeen to get hold of a local Slowpoke while I can!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you have one on you, would you trade it for my\nGalarian Slowpoke?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F0075002000680061007600650020006F006E00650020006F006E00200079006F0075002C00200077006F0075006C006400200079006F007500200074007200610064006500200069007400200066006F00720020006D0079000A00470061006C0061007200690061006E00200053006C006F00770070006F006B0065003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you have a Slowpoke like the ones you can\ncatch here in Lumiose, please trade it to me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You up to trade your local Slowpoke for my\nGalarian Slowpoke?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200075007000200074006F00200074007200610064006500200079006F007500720020006C006F00630061006C00200053006C006F00770070006F006B006500200066006F00720020006D0079000A00470061006C0061007200690061006E00200053006C006F00770070006F006B0065003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006600200063006F007500720073006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d rather not",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006400200072006100740068006500720020006E006F00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nice! Let’s hop to it, then.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00690063006500210020004C006500742019007300200068006F007000200074006F002000690074002C0020007400680065006E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Galarian Slowpoke are pretty rare around here,\nyou know. Just saying.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470061006C0061007200690061006E00200053006C006F00770070006F006B00650020006100720065002000700072006500740074007900200072006100720065002000610072006F0075006E006400200068006500720065002C000A0079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002E0020004A00750073007400200073006100790069006E0067002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m looking for a Slowpoke that can’t be found in\nGalar. Don’t let me down!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoa! This Slowpoke even SMELLS different to\nthe Slowpoke from back home!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And—my days—look at the size of it! Is it all right\nfor a Slowpoke to get this big?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I figured it’d look different, but this beefiness is\nentirely unexpected!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poooke?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F006F006F006B0065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, but there’s that same old Slowpoke face.\nSome things never change, eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for trading me this special Slowpoke. I\nalready love it to bits!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hear it’ll look even less like its Galarian\ncounterpart when it evolves into Slowbro...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, Galarian Slowbro are Poison types, so they—<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300650065002C002000470061006C0061007200690061006E00200053006C006F007700620072006F002000610072006500200050006F00690073006F006E002000740079007000650073002C00200073006F00200074006800650079201400100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oop! Actually, I’ll let you find out what happens\nfor yourself. Wouldn’t want to spoil the fun!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Take care of my Galarian Slowpoke, yeah?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061006B0065002000630061007200650020006F00660020006D0079002000470061006C0061007200690061006E00200053006C006F00770070006F006B0065002C00200079006500610068003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for the brilliant Slowpoke. Take care of my\nGalarian Slowpoke, yeah?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3596,
